{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262gpuqlk4iS1795136051.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本10月通脹率低過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>按年升百分之2.3，低過市場預期0.2個百分點，但高過9月0.2個百分點。</p><p></p><p>撇除食品的核心消費物價指數，按年升百分之2.2，較預測低0.1個百分點，但較9月高0.1個百分點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:20.701252+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:16.459775+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:26:42.252040+00:00","content_hash":"466fa0307705e3a43a07b1fdc00459c0b816cd4450d2a91672d04201428d9c9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:20.701252+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}